  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oslo Humanitarian Disarmament Roundtable 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Disarmament Roundtable for people, particularly in developing countries, affected by armed conflict, government officials/diplomats, strategically placed individuals in civil society, academic institutions/networks, and international organizations, notably international humanitarian organizations with experiences from or expertise in international norm-building processes, especially processes related to humanitarian disarmament, the protection of civilians in armed conflict, and gender. 40-50 participants.</narrative>
  </description>
